%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}, "sequence": {"diagramMarginX": 30, "actorMargin": 55, "messageMargin": 35}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Caller
    participant S as shared_ptr machinery
    participant O as Foo and CRTP base
    participant C as Control block

    U->>S: make_shared<Foo>()
    S->>C: Create ownership storage
    S->>O: Construct Foo
    Note over O: Inherited weak_ptr starts empty
    O-->>S: Construction finishes
    S->>O: Connect weak_ptr to Foo and control block
    Note over O,C: Weak connection adds no strong owner
    S-->>U: owner (strong count = 1)

    U->>O: owner->shared_from_this()
    O->>C: Promote inherited weak_ptr
    C-->>O: shared_ptr in the same ownership group
    O-->>U: self (strong count = 2)
